   "engine": "Halogen (all versions)",
   "reason": "versions 4 and 6 are Windows-only; later makefiles need GNU-ld-only options"
  },
  {
   "engine": "Koivisto (all versions)",
   "reason": "the NNUE code uses AVX2 unconditionally: no native ARM build, and emulation would make it weaker than its rating"
